nd eager prayer\nthe holy circles showed new happiness\nin their turning and their wondrous song.\nAnyone who mourns that we die here\nso we might live above has never seen there\nthe refreshment of eternal rain.\nThe One and Two and Three who lives forever,\nwho reigns always in Three and Two and One,\nuncircumscribed yet circumscribing all things—\nthis was sung three times by each spirit\nwith such melody that it would be\njust reward for any merit.\nAnd from the most divine light\nin the smaller ring, I heard a gentle voice—\nperhaps like the angel's voice to Mary—answer:","startTime":46.48,"endTime":92.32,"words":[{"word":"Like","start":46.64,"end":46.88},{"word":"dancers","start":46.88,"end":47.44},{"word":"in","start":47.44,"end":47.56},{"word":"a","start":47.56,"end":47.68},{"word":"ring","start":47.68,"end":48.24},{"word":"who,","start":48.24,"end":48.8},{"word":"urged","start":48.8,"end":49.2},{"word":"by","start":49.2,"end":49.44},{"word":"greater","start":49.44,"end":49.92},{"word":"joy,","start":49.92,"end":50.64},{"word":"lift","start":50.64,"end":50.96},{"word":"their","start":50.96,"end":51.36},{"word":"voices","start":51.36,"end":51.72},{"word":"and","start":51.72,"end":51.92},{"word":"quicken","start":51.92,"end":52.28},{"word":"their","start":52.28,"end":52.6},{"word":"steps,","start":52.6,"end":53.44},{"word":"so","start":53.44,"end":53.76},{"word":"at","start":53.76,"end":53.92},{"word":"this","start":53.92,"end":54.2},{"word":"devout","start":54.2,"end":54.68},{"word":"and","start":54.68,"end":54.88},{"word":"eager","start":54.88,"end":55.2},{"word":"prayer","start":55.2,"end":55.92},{"word":"the","start":55.92,"end":56.08},{"word":"holy","start":56.08,"end":56.52},{"word":"circles","start":56.52,"end":56.96},{"word":"showed","start":56.96,"end":57.4},{"word":"new","start":57.4,"end":57.6},{"word":"happiness","start":57.6,"end":58.12},{"word":"in","start":58.12,"end":58.24},{"word":"their","start":58.24,"end":58.48},{"word":"turning","start":58